WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.925
The crossing is where the two plans are equal.

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:08.400
The dashed line is the steady plan. The curve grows by a share each year.

3
00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:11.952
Where they meet, both are worth the same.

4
00:00:14.368 --> 00:00:17.018
A lower rate pushes the crossing later.
